{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "904fa6f37445146dfc7d1d435f687421ae05870cfb8094e472d7fd5829428e87", "ja": "時代劇のオーディション", "zh": "时代剧试镜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4000_place", "source_sha256": "d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c", "ja": "事務所", "zh": "办公室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4001_032emi", "source_sha256": "9631c84a6c600df75db1a69249ae1f95d751967601b334fbf0452be366dbeedf", "ja": "あの、仕掛け人さま。\n相談に乗っていただいてもよろしいですか？", "zh": "请问，策划执行人先生，\n我可以与您商量一件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4002_p", "source_sha256": "56aa2af53ee9b6bebd5627b1fc278157270fc80d5617f26d0c0542feee2b162c", "ja": "もちろん。\nどうしたんだ、エミリー？", "zh": "当然，\n怎么了，艾蜜莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4003_032emi", "source_sha256": "32eb5eca32c59ec1c2628e4070f1e83f1176c50a13c382678dd72fc1158c3c54", "ja": "はい。先日、選考会に出てみないかと\n声を掛けていただいた、時代劇の件なのですが……。", "zh": "是的，关于前几天被询问\n要不要参加评选的时代剧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4004_p", "source_sha256": "b2c8090e1b9fdd8a8c4cb072b64bdcacf8e1687630574b76dd954d249a78ae70", "ja": "ああ、舞台のオーディションの話か。\nそれがどうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯，舞台剧试镜的事吧，\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4005_032emi", "source_sha256": "a290851186f0c71c4e1e294c36da0eb296fe795afbda9cacc6067d417c235e8f", "ja": "はい。どれも大変、魅力のある役柄で……\nどの選考に挑むべきか、悩んでしまったんです。", "zh": "是的，每个角色都相当有魅力……\n我很苦恼该参加哪一个评选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4006_032emi", "source_sha256": "23d01d23786d4b791af9313cf086ca78e72edc30f90789ec88b92b2c9f636b75", "ja": "なので、仕掛け人さまのお知恵を拝借しようと……\nあの、私には、どれが適役と思われますか？", "zh": "所以想请策划执行人先生帮我出个主意……\n请问，您认为我适合哪个角色呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4007", "source_sha256": "f949da43771c8a451aa787000a547bbf5ecb23e24f150f839e3269f708000c6e", "ja": "くのいち", "zh": "女忍者", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4008", "source_sha256": "8cd5c7c29e810e9f5e0dc5a51e1262eeb5ea2566ddc9ef218cbbe2a637284e73", "ja": "お姫様", "zh": "公主", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4009", "source_sha256": "f36a8ea8b315b0ad9f87bfc03a14f9c627aea284d926df70cdae54e59740c162", "ja": "お女中", "zh": "侍女", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4100_p", "source_sha256": "521da97408290297b61e48121decfdf3253d68942a8a50535c4c8ed5abbf190f", "ja": "くのいち役なんていいんじゃないか？\n意外に活躍できそうだし。", "zh": "女忍者感觉还不错吧？\n而且搞不好很有表现机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4101_032emi", "source_sha256": "50c22c409815fe34725a91caa28871cf3d334346962d125583ad8ee6d8624c20", "ja": "まぁ……！　仕掛け人さまも、そう思われますか？\n私も、くのいちがよいのではと思っていました！", "zh": "哎呀……！策划执行人先生，您也这么认为吗？\n我也觉得女忍者比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4102_032emi", "source_sha256": "7524c19a5c765b26271f2d7eb879fe8057e8a148ac332063201f52c9f70ba297", "ja": "お姫様も素敵ですが、凛々しい役にも憧れます！\nそれに衣装も、かっこよくて素敵ですし……♪", "zh": "虽然公主也很棒，但我很憧憬威风凛凛的角色！\n而且服装也帅气又好看……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4103_p", "source_sha256": "400494b603488a87894d345b86a21c1c881ba75248551abc7e72032a01f8cd8d", "ja": "そうだな。かっこいい役のエミリー、\nなかなか意外性があっていいと思うよ。", "zh": "没错，饰演帅气角色的艾蜜莉，\n有种意外的惊喜，我觉得非常好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4104_032emi", "source_sha256": "1ff34686f53bae05245fdaacd38304be1aa0e7bdc3e4ff7edc53aea3316ee2f9", "ja": "まぁ、仕掛け人さまったら、かっこいいだなんて……♪\n私、照れてしまいます……ふふっ♪", "zh": "哎呀，策划执行人先生，说什么帅气呀……♪\n我会害羞的……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4105_032emi", "source_sha256": "32ce18beba3ac978a5ae73872bb1ab83b89bef12ad1208a1a0a36b3212d9eb92", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、ありがとうございました！\n私、くのいち役の選考会を受けてみますね♪", "zh": "策划执行人先生，谢谢您！\n我会参加女忍者的评选喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4200_p", "source_sha256": "7e1d331b2ea8e1df7b72955618e2d0703638bc34239cfc7a96775d363889686a", "ja": "せっかくオーディションを受けるんだし、\nお姫様役もいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "难得有机会参加试镜，\n就选公主角色吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4201_032emi", "source_sha256": "0130f31ba337ab5708760f7039f68e49c9542aeceea907fcf962d06cd8d335ec", "ja": "お姫様ですか……確かに私、一度、\n十二単衣を着てみたいと思っておりました♪", "zh": "公主吗……我的确一直都想\n穿一次十二单衣试试看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4202_p", "source_sha256": "df0c1f7b97df2571afebbef1713ba3f53df05764882b3b8561c5fa5b2dc1bd95", "ja": "十二単？\nいや、さすがに十二単ではないような……。", "zh": "十二单？\n不，感觉不会穿到十二单……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4203_032emi", "source_sha256": "3f1912f986c1f4b506c686b691933d940b9626464a27797158a924d66d24a590", "ja": "ご心配いただかなくとも大丈夫です、仕掛け人さま！\n着物をたくさん着て歩く練習は、しておきました！", "zh": "您不用担心，策划执行人先生！\n我已经练习过穿着很多层和服行走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4204_032emi", "source_sha256": "883e5e6c3de650faa7dbdfe28eb19c05316e3159f9e14dff12121af56570dbc4", "ja": "日々の鍛錬、その成果を見せる、絶好の機会ですね！\n仕掛け人さま、どうか見守っていてくださいね♪", "zh": "这是展现平日锻炼结果的大好机会呢！\n策划执行人先生，请您务必在一旁守候我喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4300_p", "source_sha256": "9ab39bac190fa07a35608df494a318187c82ccfa88fc4ffabf5a5766e9f03caf", "ja": "お女中役なんてどうだ？\n同じ役柄が何人もいるから、参考になるだろうし……。", "zh": "侍女的角色怎么样？\n同时有很多人饰演侍女，可以作为参考……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4301_032emi", "source_sha256": "b5c23e2b56b16c699305db88334030cfb5478c9b99af95bc1feeb002c8cc20cf", "ja": "仕掛け人さまがそう仰るなら、\nその役を受けてみますが……。", "zh": "既然是策划执行人先生的意思，\n我会试试这个角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4302_032emi", "source_sha256": "f4e3c33492699291dd416b90bf856745b6a7adaf7106246a922353c014a71289", "ja": "お女中ですと、やはり、帯を持って、\nくるくると回されてしまうのでしょうか……？", "zh": "扮演侍女的话，是不是会被人抓住腰带，\n然后转圈圈呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_4303_p", "source_sha256": "6e9ed198f1069655468651bd86e6b7e1a429fc28df3372b4774e9b1f1020bc03", "ja": "いや、それはないと思う……\nというか、絶対にないから、安心してくれ！", "zh": "不，我想应该是不会……\n不如说绝对不会的，你安心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
